---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Runs a dedicated outbound worker paired with the hosted `LeptosKit` app

Usage: leptoskit console worker [OPTIONS] --url <URL> --project <PROJECT> --data <DATA>

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --url <URL>          
      --project <PROJECT>  
      --data <DATA>        
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
